{"title":"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Pure_trig)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Pure trig)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Complex_trig)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Complex trig)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/9971f99b0306714f9c0dd6bb9c94871f34116649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos^3 3x+ \\cos^3 5x = 8 \\cos^3 4x \\cos^3 x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"269\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is measured in degrees and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c5501137d7eeefe285751b054a16cf75abfa48ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100&lt; x&lt; 200.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"116\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Pure_trig.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Pure_trig)\">Solution 1 (Pure trig)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Pure trig)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/f/b2f45a83830cf24bc6913f22520f4d07db803854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cos 4x\\cos x = \\cos 5x + \\cos 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"239\" height=\"14\" /> by the sum-to-product formulas. Defining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1afefd2966fde87e67802fa0f4578c77b1c38bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\cos 3x$\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/1/d114aba876e7d31ec902c152c0c05bebe53dc255.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\cos 5x$\" width=\"78\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/26601e4c6699d41d13e6ce7ba9e89eca32d13fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3 + b^3 = (a+b)^3 \\rightarrow ab(a+b) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"272\" height=\"19\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a3227533a7377ec4005aa97ec45e6274faef6632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = 2\\cos 4x\\cos x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"16\" />, so we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8b5e42382dc69750f3a649ca44f9ddcec1ef6c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos x = 0$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8903b9d7f609fd97c0f8e52d63a093b95cdb5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 3x = 0$\" width=\"79\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec56180d633d7ccb980d63a2e1b06137b0d9776.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 4x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e81939a66f7e567aef63a48f32e9f8ece3837e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos 5x = 0$\" width=\"79\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Hence we see by careful analysis of the cases that the solution set is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa1745eeac26f1846a040d0e1c89b32e8d07a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\{150, 126, 162, 198, 112.5, 157.5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"287\" height=\"18\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/b/29b9f906e80c47a8ed5cb1fd776e391c5f69b480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{x \\in A} x = \\boxed{906}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"103\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Complex_trig.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Complex_trig)\">Solution 2 (Complex trig)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Complex trig)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/55143d806b5f436a08e2893c1ef69c88d3a0da66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=\\cos(x)+i \\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />. Then, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f7aac3e57f997317789dcd4368f8a7b07ebc24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|z|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306ebd89967f3267c638cdb825ed3730d41a49ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{z}=\\frac{1}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b72f93ae890888f00b84ae514d0fe4421405900f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{z}=\\cos(x)-i \\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"167\" height=\"38\" />, and we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f5a82bef644bb6a8611a608a90f6fba37b8a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(x)=\\frac{z+\\frac{1}{z}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"42\" />. Now, this means we also have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffdbf125610c8ec23d1ef3dd3ec2543b5489875.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^{3}=\\cos(3x)+i\\sin(3x) \\rightarrow z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}} = 2\\cos(3x) \\rightarrow \\frac{z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}}{2}=\\cos(3x)\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653a8d1a0aa2c1c65f40bec83dde7ace3a1f4f93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}}{2}=\\cos(5x)\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Then, we seek the solutions to \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e9945f08dfe4291f16369b704326eb1657ba4043.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{8} \\cdot \\left(z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}\\right)^{3} + \\frac{1}{8} \\cdot \\left(z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}\\right)^{3} = 8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{64} \\cdot \\left(z+\\frac{1}{z}\\right)^{3}\\left(z^{4}+\\frac{1}{z^{4}}\\right)^{3}\\]\" width=\"514\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc873718ae4e7924cc37baf7105cade0c8873f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\rightarrow \\left(z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}\\right)^{3}+\\left(z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}\\right)^{3}=\\left(z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}+z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}\\right)^{3}\\]\" width=\"429\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p>Now, if we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b66f820025fc5ce6eec04b16e31a6e9028ce139e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" /> and we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e587b351eb9dee95a9332bab465b8d2d0b7b413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"38\" />, we actually obtain the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/6260cb101751c73ec3191bf4eed9f19013dc464d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{3}+b^{3}=(a+b)^{3} \\rightarrow ab(a+b)=0\\]\" width=\"271\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>which means we either have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/c/9bcf6f1246f0701ae4acf84dce75a38e858e3877.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Case 1:} \\hspace{3pt} z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}=0\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/233a727ffb61d51fc5edafb9fff2d7f9be019ffb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Case 2:} \\hspace{3pt} z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}}=0\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/0/ad0d1553eb94915d97d6eac559df111f8f308d44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Case 3:} \\hspace{5pt} z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}=z^{5}=\\frac{1}{z^{5}}\\]\" width=\"211\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>In Case 1, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9df2956a46bd5ec7e5f7b20003051c0b7fab2980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{12}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/4/7d4b0308dd1eec9d611e3500ad791f942d5a67f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{6} \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, we have that the possibilities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/610f084a53d216070e11b135d81eba544a80aa58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\arg[z]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919bf5d461970fc8d905d63704ef763c08594184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ec0d2e4202839322d26a23dcb13f79821df5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43be219b269ed0125cd6e0ee3cfa1657dbeaa6e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{150}^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/89510f8edd489a1b6a904286852a25366dbc43f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$210^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18ac5017c605c4cd861dc861b3f7ddc59410306c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$270^\\circ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7cc5cedb568265bfe11aaa919708eebbc5df48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$330^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>In Case 2, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4677928bfc74631f298e72dcfd31da92464f85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{20}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f6885245bae8087957d6849a2c09aa9dbaad366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^{10} \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, we have that the set of possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are 10th roots of unity shifted by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cbd9463f1635d4eaa092662987d5a67db5d2622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> counterclockwise, so we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e634914455cd3e365d0bd98ebba07b0caf86b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\arg[z] \\in \\{18^\\circ, 54^\\circ, 90^\\circ, \\underline{126}^\\circ, \\underline{162}^\\circ, \\underline{198}^\\circ, \\dots, 342^\\circ \\}\\]\" width=\"381\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>so we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> values. In case 3, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f938151ba6af6d47ba19d2743aef2e2e802983.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^{3}+\\frac{1}{z^{3}}=z^{5}+\\frac{1}{z^{5}} \\rightarrow z^{10}+z^{8}+z^{2}+1=0 \\rightarrow (z^{8}+1)(z^{2}+1)=0\\]\" width=\"522\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>so either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa20492fa98fed367f8afc8ee4fd2601e95fe90a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z \\in \\{i, -i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a primitive 8th root of unity shifted by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea5c06f0a939dc4e3d874948a0659e799845923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22.5^\\circ$\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" />, which gives \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f8762d9eb674d28f133ecbfd7fa610b7322841fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\arg[z] \\in \\{22.5^\\circ, 67.5^\\circ, \\underline{112.5}^\\circ, \\underline{157.5}^\\circ, 202.5^\\circ, 247.5^\\circ, 292.5^\\circ, 337.5^\\circ \\}\\]\" width=\"514\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The sum of all underlined values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b46490f1bc71ed73163b0c2803a0d49169442c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150+126+162+198+112.5+157.5=\\fbox{906}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"365\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I\" title=\"2006 AIME I\">2006 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017210247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 333/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1790/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 112/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10018/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   20.789      1 -total\n 74.62%   15.512      1 Template:AIME_box\n 23.61%    4.908      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2272:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017210247 and revision id 286692. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}